WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.667
Okay!

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.400
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:03.933
A.

00:00:03.933 --> 00:00:04.500
Blue,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.033
B.

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:05.567
Three,

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:06.133
C.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:06.667
Red,

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:07.767
or D.

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:08.300
Green?

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.400
Five seconds!

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:15.833
TIME'S UP!

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:17.500
The answer is...

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:17.900
B,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.300
three!

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:18.700
Red,

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.133
blue,

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:20.767
and green are colors.

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:22.400
Three is a number,

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.433
so it does not belong.

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:25.767
Here's one,

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.033
a picture puzzle!

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:29.167
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:29.567
A.

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:30.833
An empty triangle,

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.267
B.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:32.533
An empty square,

00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:32.967
C.

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:34.233
An empty circle,

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:35.067
or D.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.333
A filled triangle?

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:37.200
Five seconds!

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:43.633
TIME'S UP!

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.067
The answer is...

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:45.400
D,

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.367
a filled triangle!

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.367
The rule is the shape gets

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.333
filled in but stays the same

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:50.667
shape,

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.667
so the empty triangle becomes a

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:53.333
filled triangle.

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:54.933
Here's one,

00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:56.633
a number series!

00:00:56.633 --> 00:00:57.167
Three,

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:57.733
five,

00:00:57.733 --> 00:00:58.300
eight,

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:58.833
thirteen,

00:00:58.833 --> 00:00:59.400
twenty-one,

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.533
and then...

00:01:00.533 --> 00:01:02.200
what comes next?

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:02.733
A.

00:01:02.733 --> 00:01:03.300
Twenty-nine,

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:03.867
B.

00:01:03.867 --> 00:01:04.433
Thirty-three,

00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:04.967
C.

00:01:04.967 --> 00:01:05.533
Thirty-four,

00:01:05.533 --> 00:01:06.633
or D.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.200
Forty-four?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.333
Five seconds!

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.767
TIME'S UP!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.667
The answer is...

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:17.167
C,

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:17.667
thirty-four!

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:20.600
Add the two numbers before it:

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.067
twenty-one plus thirteen is thirty-four.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:23.967
So,

00:01:23.967 --> 00:01:25.767
are you smart or fart?

00:01:25.767 --> 00:01:27.967
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:27.967 --> 00:01:29.033
find your rank!

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:29.867
So,

00:01:29.867 --> 00:01:31.100
how did you do?

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:32.333
Comment your score below,

00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:33.567
and follow for more!
